  "purpose": "(Clinical Focus: These SNOMED CT terms represent management of parenteral nutrition therapy; this includes initiate, modify, discontinue, and maintain parenteral nutrition.),(Data Element Scope: Nutrition intervention to provide nutrients intravenously and/or via hemo or peritoneal dialysis.),(Inclusion Criteria: Terms which include management of parenteral nutrition.),(Exclusion Criteria: All other methods of nutrition care are excluded.)",
